.DS_Store
*.backup

# Raw bulk downloads. NOT a style preference — the monthly rebuild commits with
# `git add -A`, so anything left in the tree gets published. GIAS alone is 62MB.
# Every fetcher writes to /tmp instead; these are belt-and-braces.
#
# NOTE tools/data-cache/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is a *committed* build
# cache — render-pages.mjs reads the per-area basemap JSON out of it, and
# fetch-basemap.mjs calls it "small, committed" in terms. Untracking it would
# break the monthly page build.
/tmp-data/
data/raw/
*.csv
!tools/**/*.csv
